{"id":9252,"date":"2020-03-19T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2020-03-19T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/aba-telehealth-webinar-how-to-support-families-remotely\/"},"modified":"2025-06-30T17:33:43","modified_gmt":"2025-06-30T21:33:43","slug":"aba-telehealth-webinar-how-to-support-families-remotely","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/aba-telehealth-webinar-how-to-support-families-remotely\/","title":{"rendered":"ABA Telehealth Webinar: How to Support Families Remotely"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9252\" class=\"elementor elementor-9252\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b627ee4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b627ee4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c669aca\" data-id=\"c669aca\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd6e891 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fd6e891\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"videoDivHolder\"><div><video poster=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/485-MjYyNjA1_aba-telehealth-free-resources-supporting-families-remotely_thumbnail.jpg\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <source src=\"https:\/\/rtaprodmarketing.blob.core.windows.net\/rta-prod-marketingvideos\/485-MjYyNjA1_aba-telehealth-free-resources-supporting-families-remotely.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\" \/> <\/video><\/div><\/div><p><style> #videoDivHolder { width: 100%; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; } #videoDivHolder > div { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; padding-top: 56.25%; } #videoDivHolder > div video { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; } <\/style><\/p><p><strong>Recorded on:<\/strong> Thursday, March 19th, 2020<\/p><p>In response to the current COVID-19 pandemic, Rethink will be holding a special webinar to help ABA providers support the clients and families they serve through this time of uncertainty.<\/p><p>This webinar will be an overview of ABA telehealth strategies to support families remotely. We will include best practices from seasoned clinicians in our employee benefits division, who coach and train parents remotely. An overview of billing codes for telehealth services will also be provided by our business solutions team.<\/p><h2>Helpful Resources:<\/h2><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.hhs.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?q=https:\/\/www.hhs.gov\/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584756423402000&amp;usg=AFQjCNF31tochQDtJ_6jiEkg-ltCqtK60Q\">Health and Human Services Website<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.autismspeaks.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?q=https:\/\/www.autismspeaks.org\/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584756423402000&amp;usg=AFQjCNG3MNioFtsVbrt9i_1bHVEZRalSJw\">Autism Speaks<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cms.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?q=https:\/\/www.cms.gov\/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584756423402000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFSzGc4CrMIuqtWeS8FLHjOvvF8-Q\">Center for Medicaid Services<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cdc.gov\/covid\/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?q=https:\/\/www.cdc.gov\/coronavirus\/2019-ncov\/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584756423402000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHHpyIvEiKNvw6rgCGYxqM8kPWjTA\">Centers for Disease Control and Prevention<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/emergencies\/diseases\/novel-coronavirus-2019\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/url?q=https:\/\/www.who.int\/emergencies\/diseases\/novel-coronavirus-2019&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584756423402000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHSVD8h94OtcE2e_1b2b1b5il1jKg\">World Health Organization<\/a><\/li><\/ul><h2>Expect to discuss:<\/h2><p><strong>Real-life lessons of a BCBA<\/strong> who has done remote consultation\/telehealth with parents<\/p><ul><li>Best practices for engaging parents as partners in the treatment process<\/li><li>Some tips to remember when starting this type of work will be provided<\/li><li>Utilizing video conferencing to work with families<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Clinical utilization of the Rethink parent portal<\/strong>, specifically:<\/p><ul><li>How to grant parents\/guardians access to their child\u2019s Rethink account<\/li><li>Resources and Trainings for parents<\/li><li>Updating programming and behavior plans to focus on parent training and data collection<\/li><\/ul><p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/our-solutions\/practice-management\/\">Practice Management<\/a> utilization of Rethink<\/strong>, including how to:<\/p><ul><li>Update your Rethink system to account for telehealth modifiers<\/li><li>Schedule telehealth<\/li><li>Update session note templates for telehealth<\/li><li>Where telehealth will be indicated on the billing export<\/li><\/ul><p>This webinar is free and does not offer CEUs.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15063,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"[Webinar] ABA Telehealth: How to Support Families Remotely","_seopress_titles_desc":"","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[68],"resource-topic":[97,69],"resource-tag":[128],"class_list":["post-9252","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-blog","resource-topic-autism","resource-topic-business","resource-tag-webinar"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9252","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9252\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/15063"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=9252"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"audience","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/audience?post=9252"},{"taxonomy":"resource-type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-type?post=9252"},{"taxonomy":"resource-topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-topic?post=9252"},{"taxonomy":"resource-tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-tag?post=9252"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}